codex
For `dim=384`, the cuBLAS projection itself is not the main problem; the projection output is then split, gated, multiplied, converted, and permuted through several large kernels. I’m adding a lightweight Triton post-projection kernel to fuse those steps while keeping cuBLAS for the large GEMM.
