codex
The benchmark’s no-mask inputs are distinguishable: `nomask=True` creates a float32 all-ones mask, while random masks are int64. I’m adding a constexpr no-mask path in the Triton projection/post kernels to skip mask loads and multiplies for those cases while keeping masked correctness.
